        dct:description "holotype, segmentation, field, dispersion, Dv sweep, ablation bars — docs/media/anchiornis_huxleyi_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-anchiornis-huxleyi-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/png, 479241 B, 1512×984 px, artifact_sha256 2070fe4cc1a78ef379ad85d3c7d7cdd0567702fbef1c8ade501ac522ebd432d3 (sha256 2070fe4cc1a78ef379ad85d3c7d7cdd0567702fbef1c8ade501ac522ebd432d3), spec_fingerprint 285152f97d4c2953160d26c2ea513d3fd2c627cb2df9135750b22cabfa010529" .
